{
  "title": "Zestful Wholesome Meditteranean Tomato Stir-fry",
  "description": "An earthy and shaggy meal-prep Mediterranean dish featuring creme-patissiere, confit-tomato, lacto-vegetarian-friendly, served on a cedar plank.",
  "cuisine": "Mediterranean",
